<h2 id="prime-day-2026-kindle-deals">Amazon Prime Day 2026 Kindle Deals: What to Buy and How to Transfer Your Library</h2>

<p>Prime Day June 2026 is here, and for the first time in years, every major Kindle model is on sale simultaneously. The <strong>Kindle Paperwhite</strong> is at a 2026 low, the <strong>Kindle Scribe</strong> bundles are heavily discounted, and the new <strong>Kindle Colorsoft</strong> is seeing its first real price drop since launch.</p>

<p>If you have been waiting to upgrade your e-reader — or buying your first Kindle — this is the best Prime Day lineup in recent memory. But upgrading also means dealing with your existing ebook library. How do you transfer books from an old Kindle to a new one? What about EPUB files you have collected from other sources? And what happens to your Amazon library when you trade in your old device?</p>

<p>This guide covers the best Prime Day Kindle deals, how to transfer your EPUB library to a new Kindle, and the smartest workflow for managing ebooks across devices.</p>

<hr />

<h2 id="best-prime-day-kindle-deals-2026">Best Prime Day 2026 Kindle Deals</h2>

